 A set of 10 ablation variants (A-J) testing individual components of the INPC pipeline on outdoor MipNeRF360 scenes [S3].
-*   **A)** Remove D-SSIM loss.
-*   **B)** Remove VGG loss.
-*   **C)** Remove weight decay regularization.
-*   **D)** Omit octree subdivision during optimization.
-*   **E)** Disable bilinear splatting.
-*   **F)** Disable multisampling during inference.
-*   **G)** Remove SfM prior for sampling probability initialization.
-*   **H)** Remove background model.
-*   **I)** Remove residual FFC block in the U-Net.
